  "translation": "sapos tripela yia hangre; o sapos tripela mun yu ⟨em⟩ i lus long pes bilong ol birua bilong yu, na bainat bilong ol birua bilong yu i kasem yu; o sapos tripela de bainat bilong Yahwe na sik nogut long graun, na mesinja bilong Yahwe i bagarapim long olgeta boda bilong Yisrael. Na nau lukim: wanem tok bai mi bekim ⟨את⟩ man i salim mi?",
